          {
            "typeName": "notesText",
            "multiple": false,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": "This Plural scenario uses the cited NFF scenarios by combining their elements - specifically certain decision rules designed to translate the different environmental values - for a hybrid or 'pluralistic' land-use outcome. The NFFs, in turn, are constructed following an SSP1 baseline."
